  "title": "Sinclair Wins Four RTDNA National Edward R. Murrow Awards for Excellence in Local Journalism",
  "summary": "BALTIMORE – August 13, 2026 – Sinclair today announced four of its content centers across the country have been honored with RTDNA National Edward R. Murrow Awards, recognizing outstanding achievements in broadcast and digital journalism. Presented by the Radio Television Digital News Association (RTDNA), the Edward R. Murrow Awards are among the most prestigious honors...",
